# Copy to .env (already excluded by .gitignore). Loaded by gns3-collector.service at startup via EnvironmentFile=.
#
# The collector has no ESXi password of its own. For every ESXi host that has no esxi_password in the config (or in a
# stored host profile) it asks the Operator's gateway for that host's login:
#   GET <OPERATOR_URL>/internal/host-credentials?ip=<esxi ip>   with   Authorization: Bearer <OPERATOR_TOKEN>
# OPERATOR_TOKEN must equal XEONIS_COLLECTOR_TOKEN on the Operator (at least 32 random characters, keep this file mode 0600).
# HTTP 401: check both token settings. HTTP 503: set a valid XEONIS_COLLECTOR_TOKEN on the Operator to enable the endpoint.
OPERATOR_URL=http://operator.example:8123
OPERATOR_TOKEN=change-me-to-32-or-more-random-characters
